sequenceDiagram
    participant CP as CreateCheckPoint
    participant CG as CheckPointGuts
    participant CB as CheckPointBuffers
    participant BS as BufferSync
    participant SO as SyncOneBuffer
    participant FB as FlushBuffer
    participant SM as smgrwrite
    participant WT as WritebackContext
    participant PS as ProcessSyncRequests

    Note over CP: Begin checkpoint critical section
    CP->>CG: CheckPointGuts(redo, flags)

    Note over CG: Checkpoint core components
    CG->>CB: CheckPointBuffers(flags)
    CB->>BS: BufferSync(flags)

    Note over BS: Scan buffer pool for dirty buffers
    BS->>BS: Lock each buffer header
    BS->>BS: Mark BM_CHECKPOINT_NEEDED
    BS->>BS: Build CkptBufferIds array

    Note over BS: Sort buffers by tablespace/relation/block
    BS->>BS: sort_checkpoint_bufferids()
    BS->>BS: Allocate per-tablespace progress tracking
    BS->>BS: Build binary heap for load balancing

    loop For each buffer in sorted order
        BS->>SO: SyncOneBuffer(buf_id, false, wb_context)

        Note over SO: Check if buffer still needs writing
        SO->>SO: LockBufHdr(bufHdr)

        alt Buffer is dirty and marked BM_CHECKPOINT_NEEDED
            SO->>SO: PinBuffer_Locked(bufHdr)
            SO->>SO: LWLockAcquire(ContentLock, LW_SHARED)

            SO->>FB: FlushBuffer(bufHdr, NULL, IOOBJECT_RELATION, IOCONTEXT_NORMAL)

            Note over FB: WAL-before-data rule enforcement
            FB->>FB: Check LSN vs RedoRecPtr

            alt WAL needs flushing first
                FB->>FB: XLogFlush(BufferGetLSN(bufHdr))
            end

            Note over FB: Prepare page for disk write
            FB->>FB: PageSetChecksumCopy(page, buf_id)
            FB->>SM: smgrwrite(reln, forkNum, blockNum, page)
            FB->>FB: TerminateBufferIO(bufHdr)

            SO->>SO: LWLockRelease(ContentLock)
            SO->>SO: UnpinBuffer(bufHdr)

            Note over SO: Schedule writeback for batching
            SO->>WT: ScheduleBufferTagForWriteback(wb_context, tag)
        else
            Note over SO: Buffer clean or already written
            SO->>SO: UnlockBufHdr(bufHdr, buf_state)
        end

        Note over BS: Update progress tracking
        BS->>BS: Update tablespace progress
        BS->>BS: CheckpointWriteDelay() for I/O throttling
    end

    Note over BS: Issue all pending writebacks
    BS->>WT: IssuePendingWritebacks(wb_context)

    Note over CG: Continue with other checkpoint components
    CG->>CG: CheckPointCLOG()
    CG->>CG: CheckPointSUBTRANS()
    CG->>CG: CheckPointMultiXact()

    Note over CG: Process all fsync requests
    CG->>PS: ProcessSyncRequests()

    loop For each pending fsync request
        PS->>PS: Perform fsync on data files
    end

    Note over CG: Complete two-phase checkpoint
    CG->>CG: CheckPointTwoPhase(checkPointRedo)

    Note over CP: End checkpoint critical section